    env_snapshot_direct: EnvironmentSnapshot,
) -> AsyncGenerator[Orchestrator, None]:
    """Provide a fully wired ``Orchestrator`` in the ``BOOTING`` state.

    Dependencies
    ------------
    - ``EventBus`` (fresh per test)
    - ``AppConfig`` (defaults)
