    ) -> ScreenshotResult:
        """Capture a screenshot.

        Parameters
        ----------
        region : tuple[int, int, int, int] | None
            Capture region ``(left, top, width, height)``. ``None`` for
            full screen.
        save_path : str | None
            Optional path to save the image file.

        Returns
        -------
        ScreenshotResult
            Captured image data.
        """

